  "summary": "The Sagrada Família is a Roman Catholic minor basilica in Barcelona designed by Antoni Gaudí. Construction began in 1882 and was still unfinished in the early 21st century. A pope consecrated it in 2010, and Gaudí's Nativity façade and Crypt are part of a UNESCO World Heritage listing.",
